**What to do**

1. **Install the plugin** – follow the plugin’s installation instructions (e.g. `git clone https://github.com/understand-anything/understand-anything-plugin.git ~/.understand-anything-plugin && cd ~/.understand-anything-plugin && pnpm install && pnpm --filter @understand-anything/core build`).  
   The plugin must contain a `package.json` and a `packages/core/dist/index.js` after building.

2. **Verify the installation** – after the build, run:

   ```bash
